# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Elite Pro Academy — environment variables
#
# HOW TO USE THIS FILE
#   1. Copy it:  cp .env.example .env.local
#   2. Fill in the values from the Supabase dashboard.
#   3. .env.local is git-ignored and never leaves your machine. Good.
#
# Phase 0 does not read any of these yet — there is no database code until
# Phase 3. They are documented here so the list exists before it is needed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------


# --- Supabase: safe for the browser ---------------------------------------
# Anything prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ is bundled into the JavaScript sent to every
# visitor. Only ever put public values here.
#
# Find both of these in Supabase: Project Settings -> API
#
# The "anon" key is PUBLIC BY DESIGN. It is not a password. It grants no access
# on its own — Row Level Security in the database decides what the signed-in
# user may read or write. That is why RLS is non-negotiable: the key is public,
# so the database must be the thing that says no.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here


# --- Supabase: server-only, NEVER in the browser --------------------------
# ##########################################################################
# #  THE SERVICE ROLE KEY BYPASSES ROW LEVEL SECURITY COMPLETELY.          #
# #                                                                        #
# #  It can read and write every child record in the system, ignoring      #
# #  every permission rule. Treat it like the master key to the building.  #
# #                                                                        #
# #  NEVER prefix it with NEXT_PUBLIC_.                                    #
# #  NEVER commit it.                                                      #
# #  NEVER paste it into a chat, an issue, or a screenshot.                #
# #  It belongs in Vercel's encrypted environment variables and in         #
# #  Supabase Edge Functions — nowhere else.                               #
# ##########################################################################
#
# Left commented out on purpose. Uncomment only when a server-side task
# genuinely needs it, and only in Phase 3 or later.
#
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
